<p>2017		  16,300M	 --     5.875 %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 07/01/2007 at 102.00, DTP 07/01/2009</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, November 22, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on December 12, 1996.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Piper, Jaffray, Inc.</p>
<p>Dain Bosworth Incorporated</p>
